#   - test_r1_has_a_position_on_the_runway_2026-11-01.py guards that R1 keeps a
#     named position in the RUN ORDER, and that the citation prefix of the
#     runway stays byte-stable -- 5 line citations point into it from a
#     VERBATIM transcript, and the existing citation test checks only that a
