#     guard that would catch it ran only when someone remembered to run it.
# ★★★ 104 GUARD FILES ADDED 2026-11-09 ON HIS INSTRUCTION (B103), AND THE GATE
# NOW EXCEEDS THE LIMIT THIS FILE'S OWN HEADER STATES. Both halves are
# deliberate. The second is RAISED FOR HIS RULING, not resolved here.
#
# HIS INSTRUCTION, verbatim: "Fix the 11 and then add the 103. If there are
