#
# THE COUNT IS 104, NOT THE 103 PREPARED NOR THE 54 B103 RECORDS, because the
# set is defined by a RULE and the rule admitted a new member while the work was
# being done: every file in bench/tests/ outside this list whose name carries a
# date of 2026-10-29 or later. B103 recorded 54 on 2026-11-04. 103 were outside
