#
# WHAT IT COSTS, AND THE FIGURE I FIRST REACHED FOR COULD NOT BE QUOTED. A note
# of mine cited 17 observations with a mean of 681.94 s. The ledger this gate
# writes held 6 rows; the 17 came from a session log that is not committed, so
