# none is recommended here -- composability-requires-a-measurement.
#
# THE WAITER ALREADY FITS AND NEEDED NO EDIT. scripts/cdsfl_sv.py derives its
# commit timeout as max(300, 4 x the hook's last recorded seconds), which stood
# at 2,724 s = 45.40 min when this was written, and it self-scales after the
# first slow run. His "extend it within reasonable bounds" was already
# satisfied by a mechanism, so nothing was typed.
#
# 11 TESTS ACROSS 5 OF THESE FILES WERE RED WHEN FIRST RUN TOGETHER, AND ALL 11
# WERE CAUSED BY THIS SESSION'S OWN WORK rather than by a defect in the product:
# 6 actuator citations into bench/reference_runner_v3.py that the night's edits
