# ★ THE 6 GUARDS DATED 2026-11-10 WERE ADDED 2026-11-10T14:5xZ, AND 5 OF THEM
# WERE MINE TO ADD EARLIER THE SAME NIGHT AND WERE NOT ADDED. B103's rule is
